lang: bash
expect: certain
read:
  - line=7 member= key=covers value=src/after.sh stamp= origin=comment
writable: 7
readonly: 
lookalikes: 3
comments: 7
refuse: none
native: bash-n+shfmt+bash-exec
exec: bash {file}
note: unsupported-construct class: a heredoc inside backticks that bash accepts (the M2.2 lexer refuses the one-line `cat <<EOF` form; this multi-line form is valid). A refusal here is over-refusal, never a safety failure.
